3. Name metrics in plain words (distancia total, carrera a alta velocidad, sprints, velocidad máxima, aceleraciones, RPE, carga), never with the JSON keys such as "total_distance_m". Write positions in plain words (GK arquero, DF defensor, MF mediocampista, FW delantero), never as the codes.
4. Sessions with "reduced_minutes" true are not comparable on totals: mention the reduced minutes instead of reading them as a drop in output.
5. Sessions in "sessions_without_rpe" have no RPE and no workload: say the data is missing, do not guess.
